From 5f80ce6eb6b61dcbfa7f4d3f654ebaecb89854af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:21:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: mountain vegetation up to a ragged treeline (unfinished)

Stopped before it was finished (weekly usage limit). Compiles; not
reviewed and not finally checked in game. Adds mountain trees (fir, pine,
spruce, young trees, krummholz), shrubs and alpine plants above the old
bald line (MountainFlora, MountainFloraFilter, TreeLine changes, datagen
features and biome modifiers) and a FloraStudy devtool.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P4U2ge3L4SazHBdDSoJUZ9
